<title>CROATIA: WEIGHTLIFTING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>WEIGHTLIFTING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIJEKA, Croatia 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the European</p>
<p>weightlifting championships on Saturday:</p>
<p>91 kg</p>
<p> 1. Sunay Bulut (Turkey)	   snatch 180.0 kg/clean and jerk</p>
<p>210.0 kg/total lift 387.0 kg</p>
<p> 2. Oliver Caruso (Germany)    175.0/210.0/385.0</p>
<p> 3. Oleg Cumak (Ukraine)	 172.5/210.0/382.5</p>
<p>99 kg</p>
<p>1. Stanislav Ribalcenko (Ukraine) 182.5/220.0/390.0</p>
<p> 2. Dimitri Smirnov (Russia)	 175.0/215.0/385.0</p>
<p> 3. Martin Tesovic (Slovakia)	172.5/215.0/377.5</p>
</text>
